        <tei:title type="alt" xml:lang="en">Elaha Alam (Ageless God) — a piyyuṭ for the Seder Meturgeman of the 7th Day of Pesaḥ by Meir ben Isaac Nehorai of Orléans (ca. 11th c.)</tei:title>
